d exposure, and Longo wanted the national spotlight. Official visits could decide this one.","quote":null,"kick":"Battle"}}],"games":[{"id":"831914385:upset","cat":"game","game":831914385,"week":21,"team":832438348,"user":true,"kind":"upset","kick":"Top-Spot Shocker","score":135,"h":"No. 1 Ohio State falls to Nebraska and the bracket takes a hit","d":"The top-ranked team in the country lost to Nebraska despite moving the ball. Tuddy_roosevelt's team had the yards and still left with a loss. Per a source close to the program, the mood in the building afterward was ugly.","quote":{"text":"We did everything but finish. That's what's eating guys up.","by":"a source close to the Ohio State program"},"by":"Josh Pate","rumor":true,"facts":{"h":"Chaos: No. 1 [[t:832438359|Ohio State]] goes down to [[t:832438348|Nebraska]]","d":"Nebraska outgained Ohio State 491 to 448. Somewhere a playoff bracket just broke.","quote":null,"kick":"Upset"}},{"id":"carousel:H0ldStillPlease:move:832438379:717","cat":"game","kind":"carousel","team":832438379,"user":true,"kick":"Carousel Move","score":130,"h":"Harrell Leaves East Carolina for Stanford and a Defense Full of Questions","d":"[[c:H0ldStillPlease|Coach Harrell]] is leaving [[t:832438301|East Carolina]] after going 19-19 to take over a [[t:832438379|Stanford]] program that is 0-1. The Cardinal job comes with a bigger name and a much bigger rebuild, starting with the secondary.","quote":{"text":"He wanted a bigger stage, and he knows what he's walking into on defense. Nobody there is under any illusions.","by":"a source close to the Stanford program"},"by":"Pete Thamel","rumor":true,"facts":{"h":"[[c:H0ldStillPlease|Coach Harrell]] leaves [[t:832438301|East Carolina]] for [[t:832438379|Stanford]]","d":"H0ldStillPlease is taking over at Stanford after his run at East Carolina. He went 19-19 there. [[t:832438379|Stanford]] is 0-1.","quote":null,"kick":"Coaching carousel"}},{"id":"831914385:4th:832438348","cat":"game","game":831914385,"wee